    /// Phase D2: transcript-eval collection signature.
    /// Runs `verify()` on the real poseidon proof. `verify()` now
    /// emits a `TraceIntermediate("evals_signature", sig)` event
    /// where `sig = Σ i · eval_i` over the flat transcript-read
